"y insufficient permissions in the target directory or failures in the setup o"
"f your KDE 2 installation.<br><br>If you created your own template folder, mi"
"stakes in there may also cause errors. As a last possibility, the KDE address"
" book may be buggy, too :-(.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><b>Az exportálás nem sikerült!</b><br><br>A hiba oka lehet például: "
